    <MESSAGE value="main: add credit_cards project&#10;&#10;Airflow DAG that scrapes Cal, Max and Isracard transactions daily and  &#10;publishes them to a Google Sheet with a monthly summary and status tab.&#10;&#10;- credit_cards_dag.py: DAG with three scrape tasks and a publish task&#10;  (uses TriggerRule.ALL_DONE so a failed company doesn't block the others)&#10;- scraper/scrape.js: Node script using israeli-bank-scrapers with&#10;  Chromium profile persistence to reduce OTP prompts&#10;- pipeline/: transform.py normalizes per-company JSON, store.py keeps&#10;  SQLite history, sheets.py writes the Google Sheet tabs&#10;- Dockerfile: Airflow 3.4.0 image with Node.js, Chromium and gspread&#10;- .gitignore / .airflowignore: exclude data, secrets and node_modules" />
